            'Two packs are used.',
            'Foundations build up by suit.',
            'Tableau builds down in alternating colours.',
            'Only one pass through the stock is allowed.',
            'A reserve pile may hold one king.',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        strategy: {
          basic: 'Delay filling the king reserve until it clearly opens a buried card or frees a tableau column.',
